00:11:59,559 --> 00:12:00,799
I'm Ye.

279
00:12:02,519 --> 00:12:04,840
Your beloved granddaughter, Ye.

280
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:07,279
Don't cry, Weiwei.

281
00:12:07,399 --> 00:12:09,960
Did Chengye make you suffer again?

282
00:12:11,039 --> 00:12:11,919
Don't be afraid.

283
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:13,320
Mom's here.

284
00:12:15,879 --> 00:12:17,840
(The priority
isn't taking Grandma away.)

285
00:12:17,919 --> 00:12:20,399
(I need to treat her condition first.)

286
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:26,240
Grandma, wait for me.

287
00:12:27,559 --> 00:12:29,200
I will take you away from here.

288
00:12:39,159 --> 00:12:40,639
Why call me at this hour?

289
00:12:42,039 --> 00:12:43,399
Good thing my dad's been busy.

290
00:12:43,399 --> 00:12:44,360
With my mom's mess,

291
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:45,399
he has no time for me.

292
00:12:45,919 --> 00:12:46,840
I'll get the bid documents tomorrow.

293
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:47,840
Don't you dare

294
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:49,159
forget your promise.

295
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:50,279
Okay.

296
00:12:51,279 --> 00:12:52,000
Tomorrow afternoon,

297
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:53,240
at Dushang Restaurant,

298
00:12:54,159 --> 00:12:54,879
we'll talk in detail.

299
00:13:02,399 --> 00:13:03,480
For this project,

300
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:05,399
we've invested a fortune
to grease the wheels.

301
00:13:05,639 --> 00:13:07,000
This bid decides everything.

302
00:13:07,480 --> 00:13:08,879
The bid documents are the top priority.

303
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:10,919
Keep a close eye on it.

304
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:12,240
Not a single word can be wrong.

305
00:13:12,960 --> 00:13:14,519
Dad, just rest assured.

306
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:16,919
I'll handle this beautifully.

307
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:17,879
Absolutely no mistakes.

308
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:19,399
Just keep it in mind.

309
00:13:19,759 --> 00:13:20,200
Go.

310
00:13:20,399 --> 00:13:20,919
Got it.

311
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:39,840
(Grandma's condition
can't be delayed any longer.)

312
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:41,799
(Lu Lin is the breakthrough.)

313
00:13:46,159 --> 00:13:48,519
(Lu Mingyu: Duan Xiuming,
let's grab a bite tomorrow.)

314
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:00,879
Bloody Mary.

315
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:04,720
So romantic?

316
00:14:05,480 --> 00:14:06,279
Role-playing, huh?

317
00:14:08,639 --> 00:14:10,240
See that private room?

318
00:14:12,639 --> 00:14:14,159
Force the guys inside out.

319
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:15,639
Make a big scene.

320
00:14:15,879 --> 00:14:16,960
But don't hurt anyone.

321
00:14:24,600 --> 00:14:25,320
Wait.

322
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:54,120
(What's going on?)

323
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:57,519
(Get out of here, hurry!)

324
00:15:27,339 --> 00:15:28,119
(Bid documents)

325
00:16:02,417 --> 00:16:07,032
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

326
00:16:09,582 --> 00:16:13,502
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

327
00:16:16,517 --> 00:16:21,210
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

328
00:16:22,327 --> 00:16:27,277
♪Chimes and cicadas have loved so long♪

329
00:16:29,667 --> 00:16:35,848
♪A love letter written in song♪

330
00:16:36,549 --> 00:16:41,357
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

331
00:16:43,871 --> 00:16:49,792
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

332
00:16:50,569 --> 00:16:56,583
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

333
00:16:56,845 --> 00:17:03,765
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

334
00:17:04,725 --> 00:17:07,045
♪Close your eyes and count♪

335
00:17:07,191 --> 00:17:09,947
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

336
00:17:09,947 --> 00:17:16,365
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪
